123
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:30,970
Captain Yan.

124
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:34,090
Mr. Bai told me to ask you one last time.

125
00:13:34,710 --> 00:13:35,540
Are you leaving

126
00:13:36,590 --> 00:13:37,690
